					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751780701,
					"content": "So \"cold\"! This is so \"cold\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ma'chah"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780702,
					"content": "Huh? Cold? What are you talking about... You're sitting in a hot spring, aren't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780703,
					"content": "No, no... This still isn't enough! If I'm to become the \"strongest\" — the \"strongest\" in the Collective of Plenty, no, in all Natlan — I can't settle for just this level of cold! The \"intensity\"... it's nowhere near enough!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ma'chah"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780704,
					"content": "Eh...? Why are you sitting back down again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780705,
						751780707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780705,
					"content": "It seems the \"intensity\" still isn't enough!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780706
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780706,
					"content": "What even is this \"intensity\" you're talking about? Paimon doesn't understand a word you're saying!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780709,
					"content": "#Oh, you must be the famous adventurers {NICKNAME} and Paimon! Wonderful! Now we're saved!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780710,
					"content": "Wh—What? Saved? What's going on...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780711,
					"content": "Alright, I'll spill the beans. According to the master himself, he's on a journey to become the \"strongest.\" To that end, he's fully immersed himself in some sort of hot spring training!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780712,
					"content": "Wait, training? In a hot spring?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780713,
					"content": "Yeah... I know it sounds crazy, but he got this idea from some martial arts book titled \"The Book of Five Springs.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780714,
					"content": "The book says that if you follow its teachings, you can eventually <color=#00E1FFFF>make cold water boil</color> just by using your own \"intensity.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780715,
					"content": "And that's not even the wildest part! The book's full of insane stories about martial arts legends — like one guy who punched straight through a mountain in one night, and another who could crush rocks into gemstones with his bare hands!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780716,
					"content": "#Paimon never imagined there could be such incredible martial arts in the world! If you could learn them too, {NICKNAME}...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780717,
						751780718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780717,
					"content": "Whoa, that's like something straight out of a novel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780719,
					"content": "Look, I get it — it sounds ridiculous. But this isn't just any random book. Our master found it in the collections owned by the Masters of the Night-Wind, so it's gotta be legit, right? And more importantly, he believes in it completely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780720,
					"content": "That's why he picked this specific hot spring — or rather, this \"cold spring.\" His goal is to transform the freezing cold water into a true hot spring using nothing but sheer \"intensity\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780721,
					"content": "Wait... it's true! This water's ice-cold! But won't he get sick from staying in water like this for so long, no matter how strong he is?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780722,
					"content": "Yeah, exactly! And even if he doesn't get sick, this can't go on forever. Our \"Warrior's Challenge\" has been put on hold for days, and everyone's waiting for him to come back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780723,
					"content": "But the master keeps saying that giving up halfway would mean he doesn't have enough \"intensity.\" He's sworn that he won't leave until the water starts boiling.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780724,
					"content": "The spring's manager has no idea why the water's gone cold in the first place. Honestly, if only we had some skilled adventurers around to help out... Look, I've even prepared a reward! All this, for anyone who can solve the problem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780725,
						751780726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780725,
					"content": "Maybe you should call someone from the People of the Springs to help out...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780727
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780727,
					"content": "(Hey, let's not be so quick to turn him down. Let's check out how much he's offering first, at least!)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780728,
					"content": "Ahem, don't worry — we'll get this spring heated up again. Besides, we can't just let the master sit in freezing water until he gets sick. Helping people is what good adventurers do, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780729,
					"content": "Oh, thank you! I'll be counting on you, then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yoleehe"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780730,
					"content": "You just stay here. We'll have this sorted out in no time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751780726,
					"content": "Are you seriously trying to bribe me with that reward right now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780727
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780718,
					"content": "You don't actually believe that, do you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780707,
					"content": "It's probably because standing up makes him feel even colder...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751780708,
					"content": "Paimon thinks so too. No wonder he's shaking like a leaf!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751780709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
